      <p begin="01:58.150" end="01:59.860" ttm:agent="v1">La-la-la-la, la-la-la</p>
      <p begin="01:59.860" end="02:02.600" ttm:agent="v1">Girls never die, 절대 never cry</p>
      <p begin="02:02.600" end="02:07.780" ttm:agent="v1">날 따라와 달라진 날, 하나가 되자</p>
      <p begin="02:07.780" end="02:12.830" ttm:agent="v1">너의 꿈이 내가 되고, 우리 함께 꾸는 꿈</p>
      <p begin="02:12.830" end="02:17.300" ttm:agent="v1">두려움 따위다, 함께 있다면은 이제 무서울 것 없지</p>
      <p begin="02:17.300" end="02:18.800" ttm:agent="v1">다시 해볼까?</p>
      <p begin="02:18.580" end="02:22.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Smaerd ruof ytnewt, eno sa etinu we (yeah, yeah, yeah)</p>
